  "interpretation": {
    "natural": "Visitor history contributes reproducible continuous response structure despite substantial single-trajectory demographic noise.",
    "large_capacity": "Increasing plant capacity reduces demographic residual and increases continuous history reliability even while mixed-sign history counts nearly disappear.",
    "visitor_pooled": "Pooling visitor histories nearly removes the reproducible history signal while also eliminating mixed-sign history labels.",
    "core": "The same categorical increase in apparent parallelism (fewer mixed-sign histories) can arise by opposite mechanisms: reducing demographic noise can reveal a stronger history signal, whereas averaging visitor histories erases that signal."
